  "hypothesis": "A persistent OpenMP column pipeline publishing 32-row batches can reduce synchronization overhead relative to anti-diagonal tile barriers while keeping four workers busy.",
  "notes": "Unmeasured candidate. Worker count respects the OpenMP maximum and is capped at four. Small grids and builds without OpenMP use the serial path; the controller must establish correctness and crossover.",
